        "title": "Overview",
        "content": "# Module 14: Negotiation and Relationship Money Skills\n\nMODULE 14: Negotiation and Relationship Money Skills\n(ADVANCED LIFE SKILLS)\n\nSo far, you have learned how to earn, how to save, how to invest, how to budget — all of that. But there is one skill that can save you the most money and one skill that can earn you the most money and preserve relationships, and that is **negotiation** and **communication about money**. This module will teach you both. These are skills that colleges never teach you but are needed most in real life. Whether it is your first salary, your rent, your freelance rate, or money talks with your partner — this module will arm you with everything. Ready? Let us start.\n\n---",
