        "title": "What is Negotiation — Money's Biggest Skill (Part 3)",
        "content": "**Step 2: Dealer Comparison**\n\n| Dealer | On-Road Price |\n|--------|--------------|\n| Dealer A (Honda) | ₹94,000 |\n| Dealer B (Honda) | ₹90,500 |\n| Dealer C (Honda) | ₹88,500 |\n\n**Step 3: The Negotiation**\n\nKunal negotiates with Dealer C:\n\nKunal: \"I am paying cash and need delivery this month. You are giving ₹88,000 on-road with free accessories. If you can do ₹87,000 on-road with a free helmet, I will book today.\"\n\nDealer: \"Sir, ₹87,000 is too low. ₹88,000 is possible with a helmet.\"\n\nKunal: \"₹87,500 final — with helmet and first service free.\"\n\nDealer: (thinking — it is end of quarter, need to hit targets) \"Done, ₹87,500 with helmet and free first service.\"\n\n**Savings Breakdown:**\n\n| Item | Original Price | Negotiated Price | Saved |\n|------|---------------|-----------------|-------|\n| On-road price | ₹94,000 | ₹87,500 | ₹6,500 |\n| Accessories | ₹4,000 | ₹2,000 | ₹2,000 |\n| Insurance (group discount) | — | — | ₹1,500 |\n| Free first service | ₹1,500 | ₹0 | ₹1,500 |\n| **Total Saved** | — | — | **₹13,500-₹15,000** |\n\n**Time Invested:** 2 weeks research + 3 dealer visits + 1 hour negotiation\n**Money Saved:** ₹15,000\n**Hourly Rate:** ₹15,000 / 23 hours = **₹652/hour**\n\nCan you earn ₹652 per hour anywhere else? That is the power of negotiation!\n\n---",
