        "cardIndex": 1,
        "totalCardsInTopic": 3,
        "title": "Salary Negotiation — First Job's Biggest Decision",
        "content": "### Why Negotiate Salary — Lifetime Impact Calculator\n\nThis is the most important section in this module. If you are a college student or looking for your first job, listen carefully — **your starting salary can impact your lifetime earnings by 20-30%.**\n\n**Compound Effect Calculator:**\n\n| Scenario | Starting Salary | Annual Raise (8%) | 10-Year Total | 20-Year Total |\n|----------|----------------|-------------------|---------------|---------------|\n| Accepted first offer | ₹4.0 LPA | 8% annually | ₹58.3 lakh | ₹1.62 crore |\n| Negotiated ₹1 LPA more | ₹5.0 LPA | 8% annually | ₹72.9 lakh | ₹2.02 crore |\n| Negotiated ₹2 LPA more | ₹6.0 LPA | 8% annually | ₹87.4 lakh | ₹2.42 crore |\n\n**Difference of ₹2 LPA starting = ₹84 lakh more over 20 years!**\n\n### When to Negotiate vs When to Accept\n\n| Situation | Negotiate? | Why? |\n|-----------|-----------|------|\n| First job offer (campus placement) | Yes | Company has budget kept aside |\n| First internship (paid) | Yes (politely) | If you are skilled |\n| Dream company, fixed CTC | Carefully | Find out how much is possible |\n| Startup offer (equity + cash) | Yes | Cash component is negotiable |\n| Government job (fixed pay scale) | No | Pay commission based, fixed |\n| Very small company, tight budget | A little | Negotiate benefits (WFH, learning) |\n| You have multiple offers | Yes | Use as leverage |\n| Internal promotion | Yes | Your track record is your data |\n\n### Research Phase: How to Know Market Salary\n\n**Salary Research Tools for India:**\n\n| Tool | Best For | Accuracy | Free? |\n|------|---------|----------|-------|\n| **Glassdoor** | MNCs, IT Companies | High | Yes |\n| **LinkedIn Salary** | Professional roles | Medium-high | Yes |\n| **AmbitionBox** | Indian Companies | High | Yes |\n| **Levels.fyi** | Tech Companies | Very High | Yes |\n| **PayScale** | Global + Indian roles | Medium | Partially |\n| **Individual company HR** | Specific offers | High | Yes |\n\n---",
        "color": "#10B981",
        "emoji": "🤝",
        "interactiveType": "no"
