        "content": "### Scenario 1: Salary Negotiation with HR\n\n**Situation:** TCS offers ₹3.6 LPA. Market rate ₹4-5 LPA.\n\n**Script:**\n> \"Thank you for the offer. After researching market rates on Glassdoor, the range is ₹4-5 LPA. Given my skills in [specific], would ₹4.5 LPA be possible?\"\n\n**Expected Response:** \"Standard fresher package.\"\n\n**Counter:** \"I have another offer at ₹4.2 LPA. TCS is my first choice. Could we match ₹4.2 LPA or add a joining bonus?\"\n\n**Win-Win:** ₹3.8 LPA + ₹20,000 joining bonus.\n\n---\n\n### Scenario 2: Rent Negotiation with Landlord\n\n**Situation:** Landlord wants ₹20,000. Similar flats ₹17,000-19,000.\n\n**Script:**\n> \"Uncle, similar flats are ₹17,000-19,000. Would you consider ₹18,000? I will sign a 2-year agreement and pay 3 months advance.\"\n\n**Expected Response:** \"₹20,000 is my final rate.\"\n\n**Counter:** \"What if I take care of minor maintenance and pay 6 months advance?\"\n\n**Win-Win:** ₹18,500/month + 6-month advance.\n\n---\n\n### Scenario 3: Bill Negotiation with Internet Provider\n\n**Situation:** Paying ₹999/month. Competitor offers ₹699.\n\n**Script:**\n> \"Hi, I have been a customer for 2 years. [Competitor] offers ₹699 for same speed. Can you match that?\"\n\n**Expected Response:** \"We have a plan at ₹799.\"\n\n**Counter:** \"That is still ₹100 more. Can you match ₹699? I will commit for 12 months.\"\n\n**Win-Win:** ₹699/month for 12 months.\n\n---\n\n### Scenario 4: Freelance Rate Negotiation with Client\n\n**Situation:** Client wants website for ₹8,000. Your rate is ₹15,000.\n\n---",
