        "content": "### Negotiation Cheat Sheet\n\n| Step | Action | Key PHRASE |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| 1. Research | Know market rate | \"Check Glassdoor for salary\" |\n| 2. Prepare | Get data ready | \"Make achievements list\" |\n| 3. Open | Speak confidently | \"I was hoping we could discuss...\" |\n| 4. Listen | Understand them | \"So you are saying...\" |\n| 5. Counter | Make reasonable counter | \"Could we meet at...?\" |\n| 6. Compromise | Find middle path | \"What if we...?\" |\n| 7. Close | Get written confirmation | \"Can we get this in writing?\" |\n\n### Money Conversation Starters\n\n| Situation | Starter Line |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| Dating (early) | \"What is your take on saving vs spending?\" |\n| Dating (serious) | \"Where do you see yourself financially in 5 years?\" |\n| Before marriage | \"Let us talk about our finances openly\" |\n| With parents (sending money) | \"I want to help. Let me show you my budget\" |\n| With partner (budget) | \"How should we split our expenses?\" |\n| With boss (raise) | \"I would like to discuss my compensation based on my contributions\" |\n| With HR (offer) | \"Could you share the salary range for this role?\" |\n\n### Relationship Money Checklist\n\n- [ ] Financial values discussion done\n- [ ] Income disclosure complete\n- [ ] Debt disclosure complete\n- [ ] Shared financial goals set\n- [ ] Expense splitting method decided\n- [ ] Joint vs separate accounts decided\n- [ ] Family responsibilities discussed\n- [ ] Emergency fund plan in place\n- [ ] Insurance coverage reviewed\n- [ ] Investment strategy aligned\n- [ ] Written financial agreement created\n- [ ] Monthly money check-in scheduled\n\n### Joint Account Agreement Template\n\n```\nJOINT FINANCIAL AGREEMENT\n\nWe, [Partner A Name] and [Partner B Name], agree to the following:\n\n1. SHARED EXPENSES:\n - Monthly budget: ₹[amount]\n - Who pays what: [details]\n\n2. INDIVIDUAL SPENDING:\n - Partner A personal: ₹[amount]/month\n - Partner B personal: ₹[amount]/month\n\n3. SAVINGS GOALS:\n - Emergency fund: ₹[amount]/month\n - [Goal 1]: ₹[amount]/month\n - [Goal 2]: ₹[amount]/month\n\n4. FAMILY CONTRIBUTIONS:\n - Partner A family: ₹[amount]/month\n - Partner B family: ₹[amount]/month\n\n5. MAJOR PURCHASES (>₹[amount]):\n - Must discuss before buying\n - Mutual agreement required\n\n6. REVIEW:\n - Monthly check-in on [Date]\n - Annual review of goals\n\nSigned: _____________ Date: _____________\nSigned: _____________ Date: _____________\n```\n\n---",
