        "content": "1. **Negotiation is a life skill** — it happens every day, not just in business\n2. **Salary negotiation** can impact lifetime earnings by ₹60-90 lakh\n3. **Research is power** — negotiation without data is emotional begging\n4. **Keep your BATNA ready** — always have your best alternative prepared\n5. **Win-win mindset** saves relationships and money\n6. **Money conversations** are important in relationships — they may feel awkward, but they are necessary\n7. **Talk about money before marriage** — best investment for the future\n8. **Joint vs separate accounts** — no right answer, choose what works for you\n9. **Set family boundaries** without guilt, with clarity\n10. **Conflict resolution** — do not speak when heated, use \"I feel\" statements, focus on goals\n\n### Final Motivational Message\n\nFriend, after reading this module you might feel there is too much to learn. And that is true! But remember — **every expert was once a beginner.**\n\nThe best way to learn negotiation is **to practice.** Start with small situations:\n- Ask the auto-rickshaw driver for meter fare\n- Look for coupons while shopping online\n- Split bills proportionally with friends\n- Discuss WFH with your manager\n\nEvery negotiation makes you better. And in relationships — **communication is everything.** Talking about money feels awkward, but if you do not talk, problems will not get solved.\n\n**Remember:** Money and relationships are both important. Do not sacrifice one for the other — find balance. Negotiate smart, communicate openly, and move ahead in life!\n\n---",
